    "description": "Welcome to 72-74 Cumberland Street, a rare offering in one of San Francisco\u2018s most vibrant neighborhoods.  On the market for the first time in 80 years, the timing is perfect for a \u201clive-and-rent\u201d owner occupant, investor or developer. A mere half block from your front door is the amazing 16 acre Dolores Park featuring a massive children\u2019s playground, sport courts, dog play area and of course picnicking/sunbathing in its sunny & warm microclimate. This fabulous 1932 Mission Dolores Duplex is 3,110 square feet offering the perfect blend of classic charm, solid fundamentals and upside potential. The attached  2 car garage, basement bonus rooms, level backyard with garden all add to the wonderful appeal of this 3 story gem. Both 2 bedroom 1 bath units have abundant natural light, period details and iconic San Francisco views. Additional highlights include rich hardwood floors, arched doorways, spacious living room with fireplace, Bay Window with window seat, formal dining room, bright kitchen with breakfast room and built-in buffet plus so much more. Proximity to multiple thriving neighborhoods, transit, dining and walkable amenities make this property a true Standout!"
  },
